      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Sleek Design for Modern Living Chicago Apartments</p>
<p><a href="/floor-plans">View Floor Plans</a></p>
<p>Smart living on display in Downtown Chicago</p>
<p><a href="#">Schedule a Tour</a></p>
<p>312-450-0635 165 W Superior St, Chicago, IL 60654</p>
<p>Views for days</p>
<p>Cozy comfort</p>
<p>Sun soaked vibes</p>
<p>Sweat Session</p>
<h1>Urban Living Never Looked So Good</h1>
<section class="answer-block" id="quick-answer">
<h2>Quick Answer</h2>
<p>Exhibit On Superior is a River North apartment community at 165 W Superior St in Chicago with studio, one, two, and three-bedroom apartments, full-building amenities, on-site retail, and quick access to downtown neighborhoods.</p>
</section>
<section class="faq-block" id="common-questions">
<h2>Common Questions</h2>
<h3>Where is Exhibit On Superior located?</h3>
<p>Exhibit On Superior is located at 165 W Superior St, Chicago, IL 60654 in the River North area.</p>
<h3>What apartment sizes are available at Exhibit On Superior?</h3>
<p>The community offers studio, one, two, and three-bedroom apartment homes. Current availability is maintained through Highland Management LLC.</p>
<h3>How do I check current availability?</h3>
<p>Use the Available Units link to view current Exhibit On Superior availability: https://www.highlandptrs.com/chicago-availability?search=exhibit.</p>
</section>
<p>Discover the perfect fit for your on-the-go lifestyle at Exhibit on Superior, where modern apartments in Chicago’s vibrant River North neighborhood put everything within reach. From fitness to food to relaxation, CycleBar, Club Pilates, Goddess and the Baker, Train Moment, and LaPerior Foot Spa are all right here in the building. This is your social hub, entertainment zone, wellness retreat, and relaxing oasis all rolled into one, with endless amenities at every turn. At Exhibit on Superior, every day is anything but ordinary.</p>
<p><a href="/amenities">View our amenities</a></p>
<h2>Get A Glimpse Of the Exhibit On Superior Lifestyle</h2>
<p><a href="/photo-gallery">Photo Gallery</a></p>
<h2>Slide into our DMs</h2>
<h2>Less clutter. Less "stuff" More time. More Freedom</h2>
<p>Exhibit on Superior is not one-size fits all. It’s designed to be a true original, every bit as unique as you are. Living here is all about creating a complete lifestyle that lets you be you while efficiently using your time and space how you want. Our sleek, contemporary homes are meant for relaxed lounging, formal entertaining, and everything in between. Choose from stylishly appointed studio, one, two, and three-bedroom apartments designed with comfort and brimming with style.</p>
<p>Want to learn more? Start the conversation today with one of our leasing agents.</p>
<p><a href="/floor-plans">View floor plans</a></p>
<h2>Connect With Us on Social Media</h2>
<h2>Urban Bliss Just Outside Your Door</h2>
<p>Make the most of the vibrant city with a home base that puts everything at your fingertips. From cozy cafés and trendy restaurants to sprawling parks and convenient shops, you’ll find it all just steps away. Take a quick trip to Target or spend the afternoon along the Chicago River.</p>
<p>Located in River North, our welcoming neighborhood offers the perfect blend of energy and ease with West Loop, Old Town, and Fulton Market just minutes away for even more dining, shopping, and cultural experiences. When it’s time to head out, nearby access to major roadways and public transit makes getting around the city a breeze.</p>
<p>Exhibit on Superior is your urban hub for fun and convenience in the heart of Chicago.</p>
<p><a href="/neighborhood">Explore The Neighborhood</a></p>
<p>Embrace Unbounded City Living At Exhibit On Superior</p>
<p><a href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a></p>
