    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[Floor Plans]]></title>
      <link>https://www.rentatexhibit.com/floor-plans</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 21:35:39 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[highland]]></dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.rentatexhibit.com/?page_id=2</guid>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Floor Plans</p>
<h1>Smartly Designed Residences Studio, 1, 2 &amp; 3 Bedroom Apartments</h1>
<section class="answer-block" id="quick-answer">
<h2>Quick Answer</h2>
<p>Exhibit On Superior has studio, one, two, and three-bedroom floor plan options in River North Chicago. The floor plans page should stay on-site, while current unit availability routes to Highland's availability page and applications route to AppFolio.</p>
</section>
<section class="faq-block" id="common-questions">
<h2>Common Questions</h2>
<h3>Does Exhibit On Superior have studio apartments?</h3>
<p>Yes. Exhibit On Superior includes studio floor plan options along with one, two, and three-bedroom homes.</p>
<h3>Where can I see available units?</h3>
<p>Current availability is handled through Highland Management LLC at https://www.highlandptrs.com/chicago-availability?search=exhibit.</p>
<h3>Where do I apply?</h3>
<p>Applications should use the AppFolio Apply Now link: https://highlandrealestatepartners.appfolio.com/apply/9ccea374-8cca-48fa-8f86-4aff06b01f03/start?source=Website.</p>
</section>
<p><iframe src="https://sightmap.com/embed/r5v516ejwny" title="Exhibit On Superior site map" loading="lazy"></iframe></p>
<h2>Live smart, Live Beautifully Studio, 1, 2 &amp; 3 Bedroom Floor Plans</h2>
<p>Choose your perfect floor plan and step up to a trend-forward home that provides the ultimate respite from the hustle and bustle of Chicago. Packed with stylish features and life-enhancing extras, the studio, one, two, and three bedroom apartments at Exhibit On Superior are designed for ultimate modern living. Enjoy a space that's uniquely yours, perfect for both relaxing and entertaining right here at Exhibit.</p>
<p><a href="https://highlandrealestatepartners.appfolio.com/apply/9ccea374-8cca-48fa-8f86-4aff06b01f03/start?source=Website">Apply Now</a></p>
<h2>Your Space, Your Style Where creativity and city life collide</h2>
<p>Welcome home to your high-rise hideaway to a living space as vibrant as Chicago itself. Our apartments strike the perfect balance of style, comfort, and functionality in the heart of River North. Retreat to your personal sanctuary, where thoughtfully designed bedrooms feature floor-to-ceiling windows that frame stunning city views, ensuring that your private oasis is as beautiful as it is comfortable. Your dream home is just a move away!</p>
<p><a href="/photo-gallery">See More Photos</a></p>
<p>Embrace Unbounded City Living At Exhibit On Superior</p>
<p><a href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.highlandptrs.com/chicago-availability?search=exhibit">View Available Units</a></p>
<p><a href="https://highlandrealestatepartners.appfolio.com/apply/9ccea374-8cca-48fa-8f86-4aff06b01f03/start?source=Website">Apply Now</a></p>
<section class="wp-block-group exhibit-imported-media-gallery">
<h2>Property Photos</h2>
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/g5-assets-cld/image/upload/x_-3,y_1444,h_1317,w_5268,c_crop/q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy,g_center,h_500,w_2000/g5/g5-c-66idk4994-magellan-property-management-llc/g5-cl-1pt3rlq8zv-magellan-property-management-llc-chicago-il/uploads/012417_5663_hxwee6.jpg" alt="Floor Plans | Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Floor Plans | Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/g5-assets-cld/image/upload/x_225,y_0,h_3211,w_4817,c_crop/q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy,g_center,h_800,w_1200/g5/g5-c-66idk4994-magellan-property-management-llc/g5-cl-1pt3rlq8zv-magellan-property-management-llc-chicago-il/uploads/012417_5607_piqxtr.jpg" alt="Living room with blue accent wall at Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Living room with blue accent wall at Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://g5-assets-cld-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/x_0,y_0,h_1330,w_1994,c_crop/q_auto,f_auto,c_fill,g_center,h_800,w_1200/v1748368341/g5/g5-c-66idk4994-magellan-property-management-llc/g5-cl-1pt3rlq8zv-magellan-property-management-llc-chicago-il/uploads/20170601_0544_qsvo3j.jpg" alt="Apartment living area with large windows at Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Apartment living area with large windows at Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois</figcaption></figure>
</section>]]></content:encoded>
