    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[Virtual Tour]]></title>
      <link>https://www.rentatexhibit.com/virtual-tour</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 21:35:39 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[highland]]></dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.rentatexhibit.com/?page_id=4</guid>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Virtual Tour</p>
<h1>See Yourself Here</h1>
<section class="answer-block" id="quick-answer">
<h2>Quick Answer</h2>
<p>The virtual tour page lets renters preview Exhibit On Superior remotely through video and Matterport tours of apartment homes and amenity spaces.</p>
</section>
<section class="faq-block" id="common-questions">
<h2>Common Questions</h2>
<h3>Does Exhibit On Superior offer virtual tours?</h3>
<p>Yes. The virtual tour page includes video and Matterport tour embeds for apartment and amenity previews.</p>
<h3>Can I still schedule an in-person tour?</h3>
<p>Yes. Prospects can contact the leasing team by phone or email to schedule a tour.</p>
</section>
<p>Take a virtual tour of Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois. Our virtual tour is the next best thing to seeing it in person. See more of our amenities and in-home features by visiting us in person, or by heading to our Photo Gallery page for a more detailed look at our community. Reach out to our friendly leasing staff to schedule your tour today.</p>
<p><a href="/photo-gallery">Photo Gallery</a></p>
<p><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/968009600?rel=0" title="Life at Exhibit On Superior" loading="lazy"></iframe></p>
<p><iframe src="https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=773kQcHxLnz" title="Exhibit 2104 at Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois" loading="lazy"></iframe></p>
<p><iframe src="https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=kthJKtuPTJ4" title="Exhibit 605 at Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois" loading="lazy"></iframe></p>
<p><iframe src="https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=CiWCwCJuZ9c" title="Amenities at Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois" loading="lazy"></iframe></p>
<p>Embrace Unbounded City Living At Exhibit On Superior</p>
<p><a href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a></p>
<section class="wp-block-group exhibit-imported-media-gallery">
<h2>Property Photos</h2>
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://g5-assets-cld-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/x_0,y_1081,h_1206,w_4823,c_crop/q_auto,f_auto,c_fill,g_center,h_500,w_2000/v1748625551/g5/g5-c-66idk4994-magellan-property-management-llc/g5-cl-1pt3rlq8zv-magellan-property-management-llc-chicago-il/uploads/Game_area_with_arcade_games_and_wall_Scrabble_ejlvkv.jpg" alt="Virtual Tour | Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Virtual Tour | Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois</figcaption></figure>
</section>]]></content:encoded>
