      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Residents</p>
<h1>Resident Life Made Simple</h1>
<section class="answer-block" id="quick-answer">
<h2>Quick Answer</h2>
<p>The residents page should help current residents find portal, payment, maintenance, and contact resources. The old resident login should be replaced with Highland's current AppFolio resident portal URL once confirmed.</p>
</section>
<section class="faq-block" id="common-questions">
<h2>Common Questions</h2>
<h3>Where should residents log in?</h3>
<p>Use the current AppFolio resident portal URL once Highland confirms the exact destination.</p>
<h3>Who should residents contact?</h3>
<p>Residents can contact Exhibit On Superior at exhibit@highlandptrs.com or 312-450-0635.</p>
</section>
<p>Need to pay rent, submit maintenance requests, or check community updates? You’re in the right place. Log in to your portal and manage it all with ease.</p>
<p><a href="/residents">Resident Login</a></p>
<p><strong>Resident portal:</strong> Replace the previous resident login with the AppFolio resident portal URL once Highland confirms the exact link.</p>
<section class="wp-block-group exhibit-imported-media-gallery">
<h2>Property Photos</h2>
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/g5-assets-cld/image/upload/x_0,y_1606,h_1325,w_5302,c_crop/q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy,g_center,h_500,w_2000/g5/g5-c-66idk4994-magellan-property-management-llc/g5-cl-1pt3rlq8zv-magellan-property-management-llc-chicago-il/uploads/Work_spaces_with_blazing_fast_WiFi_access_d3tr2q.jpg" alt="Residents | Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Residents | Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois</figcaption></figure>
</section>]]></content:encoded>
