    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[Schedule a Tour]]></title>
      <link>https://www.rentatexhibit.com/schedule-a-tour</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 21:35:39 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[highland]]></dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.rentatexhibit.com/?page_id=12</guid>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Schedule a Tour</p>
<h1>Let us show you around</h1>
<section class="answer-block" id="quick-answer">
<h2>Quick Answer</h2>
<p>Prospective renters can schedule a tour of Exhibit On Superior by emailing exhibit@highlandptrs.com or calling 312-450-0635. If Highland adopts a scheduling tool, this page should point to that tool.</p>
</section>
<section class="faq-block" id="common-questions">
<h2>Common Questions</h2>
<h3>How do I schedule a tour?</h3>
<p>Email exhibit@highlandptrs.com or call 312-450-0635 to schedule a tour.</p>
<h3>Can I tour online first?</h3>
<p>Yes. The Virtual Tour page includes video and Matterport previews.</p>
</section>
<p>Ready to find your next home in the heart of River North? Schedule a virtual or in-person tour today and see for yourself what makes Exhibit on Superior stand out. Step inside to experience our stylish finishes, expansive amenities, and a location that puts the very best of Chicago right at your doorstep.</p>
<p>Your future home is waiting.</p>
<p>165 W Superior St Chicago, IL 60654</p>
<p>312-450-0635</p>
<p><a href="mailto:exhibit@highlandptrs.com?subject=Schedule%20a%20Tour%20at%20Exhibit%20On%20Superior">Email us to schedule a tour</a></p>
<section class="wp-block-group exhibit-imported-media-gallery">
<h2>Property Photos</h2>
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://g5-assets-cld-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/x_0,y_1320,h_1351,w_5402,c_crop/q_auto,f_auto,c_fill,g_center,h_500,w_2000/v1748625779/g5/g5-c-66idk4994-magellan-property-management-llc/g5-cl-1pt3rlq8zv-magellan-property-management-llc-chicago-il/uploads/012417_5548_ocwsdh.jpg" alt="Schedule a Tour | Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Schedule a Tour | Exhibit On Superior in Chicago, Illinois</figcaption></figure>
</section>]]></content:encoded>
      <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Schedule a tour of Exhibit On Superior in River North Chicago. Email exhibit@highlandptrs.com or call 312-450-0635.]]></excerpt:encoded>
