      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>Available Units</h1>
<section class="answer-block" id="quick-answer">
<h2>Quick Answer</h2>
<p>Current Exhibit On Superior availability is maintained by Highland Management LLC at https://www.highlandptrs.com/chicago-availability?search=exhibit.</p>
</section>
<section class="faq-block" id="common-questions">
<h2>Common Questions</h2>
<h3>Where can I see current availability?</h3>
<p>Use Highland's availability page: https://www.highlandptrs.com/chicago-availability?search=exhibit.</p>
<h3>Is availability shown directly on the rebuilt site?</h3>
<p>The recommended setup is to link out to Highland's current availability page so pricing and units stay accurate.</p>
</section>
<p><a href="https://www.highlandptrs.com/chicago-availability?search=exhibit">View Available Units</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
