    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[Apply Now]]></title>
      <link>https://www.rentatexhibit.com/apply</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 21:35:39 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[highland]]></dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.rentatexhibit.com/?page_id=15</guid>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>Apply Now</h1>
<section class="answer-block" id="quick-answer">
<h2>Quick Answer</h2>
<p>Applications for Exhibit On Superior should start through AppFolio at https://highlandrealestatepartners.appfolio.com/apply/9ccea374-8cca-48fa-8f86-4aff06b01f03/start?source=Website.</p>
</section>
<section class="faq-block" id="common-questions">
<h2>Common Questions</h2>
<h3>Where do I apply for Exhibit On Superior?</h3>
<p>Use the AppFolio application page: https://highlandrealestatepartners.appfolio.com/apply/9ccea374-8cca-48fa-8f86-4aff06b01f03/start?source=Website.</p>
<h3>Should Apply Now point to available units?</h3>
<p>No. Apply Now should point to the dedicated AppFolio application link, while Available Units should point to Highland's availability page.</p>
</section>
<p><a href="https://highlandrealestatepartners.appfolio.com/apply/9ccea374-8cca-48fa-8f86-4aff06b01f03/start?source=Website">Apply Now</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
